            "notes": "**Strategy**: Your build is not yet fully online. However, [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) enables you to pressure and farm off tanks (except Zarya and JunkerQueen).\n\nDepending on your $$$, you can choose between [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) filling any spare change with greens.\n\n**Alternate Strategy**: Vs. Zarya and JQ, since there's not much shields to shoot, I swap  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) for [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) instead.\n\n**Stat Priority**: WP   AS  Armor  Ammo\n\nDon't bother with +ammo yet.",
